Changes made for SRT Generator (brightlifecreations-projects/song-srt-generator):
  - Converted from the Hugging Face Transformers weights to CTranslate2 format with int8
    quantisation (ctranslate2 4.8.1, ct2-transformers-converter --quantization int8), for use
    with faster-whisper.
  - generation_config.json had no alignment_heads, which word timestamps need; the base model's
    (openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo: [[2,4],[2,11],[3,3],[3,6],[3,11],[3,14]]) were added before
    conversion.
  - No weights were retrained or otherwise modified.

The conversion script is model-release/hinglish-apex/build.sh in the SRT Generator repository.
